      "version": "0.12.0",
      "before": "Local Codex card_present targets used projectId, pageId and optional blockId.",
      "now": "Each target also accepts an optional description. The result includes the Page breadcrumb. Optional top-level adjustSpacing enables a live editor. Existing single and grouped calls retain their targets and order."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-17",
      "version": "0.12.0",
      "before": "guide MCP tool and mandatory guide-first discovery",
      "now": "Read the installed ShowAI Skills and their bundled operation formats. The guide MCP tool has been removed; catalog guide views and the operator CLI guide remain available. showai_capabilities reports connection capabilities without workflow instructions."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-11-16",
      "version": "0.12.0",
      "before": "show_component only returns complete presentations",
      "now": "Optional live:true with local MCP Apps adds stable viewId/revision; show_component_update/read/close operate on the same temporary view. Omitted live retains existing behavior. No old call translation is required."
    },
